# Adventurer does not compile private AI provider keys into the Android APK.
# Configure server-only model credentials in your Firebase project:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set GEMINI_API_KEY
#   firebase functions:secrets:set BOSON_API_KEY
#   firebase functions:secrets:set REVENUECAT_SECRET_API_KEY
#
# Public RevenueCat SDK keys, if used for Google Play billing, should be supplied through
# REVENUECAT_API_KEY / REVENUECAT_TEST_API_KEY Gradle properties or environment variables.
# Do not put server secrets, google-services.json, signing files, or real tokens in Git.
